  "description": "Text admission through a table recordset into Tg, one row per value: plain ASCII; Latin-1 'é'; a wide character U+20AC; mixed narrow and wide; a surrogate pair; a lone high and a lone low surrogate; an embedded NUL; a leading U+FEFF; 50 narrow and 50 wide characters (the field limit); 51 characters; then two Memo values of 4000 ASCII characters with one wide character at the start and at the end. Typed values read back; one image after all of them. Images: 'before' (the fixture copy as given), then one kept image of the closed file after each step; every step opens the database read/write, makes one mutation and closes it.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
